~ warden
Warden: The old light kept these roads safe. Something in the ruins has stirred.
- I can help with the prowlers. [if not accepted(1) /]
	do accept_quest(1)
	Warden: Defeat two mire prowlers on the causeway. Then we can discuss the ruins.
	=> END
- Tell me about the buried light. [if completed(1) and not accepted(2) /]
	do accept_quest(2)
	Warden: Recover the sanctuary relic so we can restore the road's ward. Travel east, search for keys to the sealed passages, and bring the light back to me.
	=> END
- About my assignment... [if accepted(2) and not completed(2) and not ready_to_report() /]
	Warden: Search the sealed ruin for the light. The archive may explain its history; the storeroom may hold supplies. Return here with the relic.
	=> END
- I brought back the light. [if ready_to_report() /]
	do report_to_warden()
	Warden: You have given Reach a chance to rebuild its ward. Keep the light safe, and take these supplies with our thanks.
	=> END
- My reward is still waiting. [if has_pending() /]
	do claim_pending()
	Warden: Make room in your pack if you cannot carry it all. Your reward will wait.
	=> END
- Is the light safe now? [if completed(2) /]
	Warden: Thanks to you. The paths you opened remain open, should you explore again.
	=> END
- I want to learn alchemy. [if not accepted(3) /]
	do accept_quest(3)
	Warden: Two silverleaf sprigs make one restorative draught.
	=> END
- Goodbye.
	=> END
